Z||000000||BAM-BAM||11-24-2000||08:20 PM||||  I am getting ready to relace the weather strip for the sunroof, how do I pull the old one out. I looked at it and tried a little, but I didn't want to ruin anything untill I'm fairly sure of what I am doing. Any advise is helpful. Well, any pertainent advice that is. TIA <P>  Peace, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach/KYB Susp.<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats,headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Gauges And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||5
Z||000001||robertjay||11-25-2000||12:31 AM||||I was looking through my Factory Service manual and it said that when replacing it, you glue it on the bottom and the outside edge, So I would assume they did it at the factory too.||||reg||1
